            <div class="progress">
                <div id="progressBar" class="progress-bar" role="progressbar" style="width: 100%"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="countdown" id="countdown">15:00</div>

            <p>Veuillez r�essayer apr�s le compte � rebours.</p>

